{"id":"steam-1378690","steam":1378690,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Combat Cobras","summary":"Combat Cobras is a fast-paced couch party game straight out of the golden age of arcades. Have intense battles in fully destructible arenas with up to 8 players. Last pixel standing wins.","about":"Step into the Combat Cobras Arena and experience a fast-paced couch party game straight out of the golden age of arcades. Have intense battles in fully destructible arenas with up to 8 players. Last pixel standing wins. \n\n\r\n\nFEATURES\n\n \n\n• \n Battle with up to 8 friends: \r\nPlay on your own or with up to 8 players. Kill each other using any means necessary and be the last pixel alive. \r\n \r\n \n• \n Compete in fully destructible arenas: \r\nEvery single pixel on screen in the combat arenas is fully destructible. Break other player's tails to create new opportunities, or completely tear apart the map. Anything goes.  \r\n \r\n \n• \n A large arsenal of deadly weapons: \r\nWeapons are placed around the maps and can be collected by players creating areas where engagements are inevitable. In the arena you'll find guns, missiles, mines, nukes, or even parasites. You know the usual. \r\n \r\n \n• \n An intense retro soundtrack: \r\nCombat Cobras includes a retro sound-track featuring Waveshaper and Droid Bishop along with other talented artists.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378690/6d7a2a9dd45afd8824d6c4e546490411050ac382/library_600x900.jpg?t=1771323374","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378690/header.jpg?t=1771323374","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378690/4f96f6232bb2b88945f089cc74451010bb77f2d8/library_hero.jpg?t=1771323374","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378690/header.jpg?t=1771323374","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378690/pa